  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span> Marca <strong>V</strong> (verdadero) o <strong>F</strong> (falso) según el pictograma del ejercicio 1:</div>\n    <div class=\"vf-lista\">\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>a) Hay <strong>7</strong> coches.</span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">V <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">F <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>b) Hay <strong>3</strong> bicicletas.</span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">V <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">F <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>c) De <strong>aviones</strong> hay <strong>MÁS</strong> que de <strong>barcos</strong>.</span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">V <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">F <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"vf-fila\">\n        <span>d) Del <strong>barco</strong> es del que hay <strong>MÁS</strong>.</span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">V <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n        <span class=\"marca\">F <span class=\"casilla\"></span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
